    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūdumīlwa kwa Yeliko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū nzengo gwa Yeliko gūkayikala gūlugalilwe nde nde nde, kūlwa nguno ya Baisilaeli. Walī atīho wa kūfuma mo nūūlū wa kwingīla mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Yoshwa, “Managa gīkī ū nzengo gwa Yeliko nagūtūūlaga mu nkono gwako, hamò nū ntemi, pyī na bashilikale baago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe hamò na a bashilikale bako pye a bose mukūshimīza mukūgwipīndīīlaga kamò būlī lūshikū, kūshisha shikū itandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūūlaga ho bagabīji mpungatī baakūja ū kū būtongi w'isandīko, babūkije mhembe ja mapembe ga ng'ondi. Ū mu lūshikū lwa mpungatī mukūgwipīndīīla ū nzengo ng'hangala mpungatī, kūnū a bagabīji bakūjilījaga ī mhembe jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'wigwa ī lilaka lya mhembe lyalīlīla higūlya no no no mu kūjangīīla ikanza ilīhu, pye a banhū bahoolanīje kūhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya no no no nabo; a henaho ī ndugu ya nzengo gwenūyo īkūhilimikīla īgwe hasī. Haho na haho a banhū bakūlinha kūja ū mu nzengo; būlī ng'wene akūpeela ajile mo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoshwa ū ng'witūnja bo ng'wa Nuni ūbitana a bagabīji; ūbawīla, “Līsolagi ī lisandīko lya būlagane o ng'wa SEEBA, bigele na bagabīji mpungatī baakūja ū kū būtongi walyo babūkije mhembe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūbawīla a banhū gīkī, “Andyagi ī haha yenīyī, muje mukūgwipīndīīlaga ū nzengo; abo babūūkije shilanga batongele ū kū būtongi w'isandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa aho wamala kūlūngalūnga nabo a banhū, a bagabīji abo mpungatī a baakūja babūūkije mhembe kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, būbūūka bajile, kūnū bakūjilījaga ī mhembe jabo. Na a babūūcha b'isandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA būlībūūcha, būbakūūbīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū būtongi wa bagabīji abo baafuulaga mhembe baalīko bashilikale na shilanga shabo, nū kū numa y'isandīko baalīko balang'hani na shilanga shabo. Pyī ī likanza lyenīlo ī mhembe jalīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yoshwa walī wabawīla a banhū gīkī, “Yaya ū kūyoganya, nūūlū kūfunya ilaka ling'we yaya; mutizūyomba mhayo gose gose, kūshisha lūshike ū lūshikū ūlo nakūmuwīla kūhamuka; a henaho hū mukūhamuka!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlagīla lyūbūūchiwa ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA, būgwipīndīīla ū nzengo kamò; hanuma ya henaho a banhū būshoka kū ng'hambī, būūkifuula kūshisha wela ū būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ntondo yaho ū Yoshwa ūmisha dilū, a bagabīji nabo būlīsola ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji abo mpungatī a babūūcha mhembe mpungtī, būtongela ū kū būtongi w'isandīko, būja bakūjifuulaga ī mhembe jabo. Ū kū būtongi wabo baalīko a bashilikale ba shilanga, pyī nū kū numa y'isandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA. Pyī ī likanza lyenīlo ī mhembe jalīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu lūshikū lwa kabīlī būgwipīndīīla ū nzengo kamò, būshoka kū ng'hambi; bakamala shikū itandatū bakwītaga gīko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūding'wa kwa Yeliko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa mpungatī bakabūūka dilū līīmi līlīfuma, būgwipīndīīla ū nzengo ng'hangala mpungatī, bīīta ūmo bīītīlaga na kale; gwike dūhū ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo būgwipīndīīla ū nzengo ng'hangala mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūshisha ū lūkangala lwa mpungatī, a bagabīji būlīja ī mhembe n'ilaka lya higūlya no no no lya kūjangīīla ikanza ilīhu. Nang'hwe ū Yoshwa ūbalagīla a banhū ūhaya, “Hamukagi nguno ū SEEBA wang'winhaga ū nzengo gwenūyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ū nzengo na a bikaji baamo a bose, shiigelile gūpemve moto kūbiza shakwinha kūlī SEEBA. Lahabu dūhū, ū malahya h'ūyo akūpīla, na a bose abo balīmo ū mu kaya yakwe. Nguno ū wei akababisa a badati abo twalī twabatūma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo yaya mutizūgema gete ū kūshikuumya ī shikolo īsho shiigeleelilwe kūpemva mu moto, mutiziyenheleja kūyagaala kūlwa kūsola shose shose ū mu shikolo shenīsho. Ūlū ng'wīta gīko, ī ng'hambi ya Baisilaeli mukwīyenhela saalaala, yigeleelwe kūkenaagūlwa, muyenheleje kūkenaagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī feza nī zahabu ī jose, nī shikolo sha shaba, pyī nī sha chūūma, ī shenīsho shilī sheela kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA; shikūtūūlwa ng'wibīīkīlo lya sabo jakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ī lilaka lya mhembe aho lyalīla, a banhū būhoolanīja n'ilaka lya kūhamukīla higūlya; lyahayūlīla ī lilaka lya mhembe na a banhū būhamuka, ī ndugu yūhilimikīla kūgwa hasī. Haho na haho a banhū būpeela bajile mo, būgūdima ū nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nzengo gwenūyo būgūpemba moto kūbiza shakwinha kūlī SEEBA, ī shose īsho shaalīmo, īsho shikesheemaga būshibūlaga na līlūshū; pye a banhū, bagosha na bakīma, bado na bataale, ng'ombe, ng'holo pyī nī nzobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lahabu kūpījiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa ūbawīla a bagosha a babīlī abo baalī baaja kwīdata ī sī, “Jaagi ū mu numba ya ng'wa malahya mukamfunye hanze na a bose abo balīmo ū mu kaya yakwe, gīt'ūmo mukang'wilahīlīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a basūmba abo baalī baaja ū kwīdata ī sī būja ū mu nzengo būkamfunya ū Lahabu nū ise nū nina, na a baana ba ng'wawe, pye na banhū a bangī abo baalī ba mu kaaaya ya ng'wawe. Būyīfunya pyī ī kaya ya ng'wawe bītūūla h'ipandī ilebe, hanze ya ng'hambī ya Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būgūpemba moto pyī ū nzengo nī shose īsho shalīmo, alīyo ī feza nī zahabu nī shikolo sha shaba, nī sha chūūma būshitūūla ng'wibīīkīlo lya sabo, mu numba ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa ūneka wikala mpanga ū Lahabu ū malaaaya, na a banhū ba mu kaya ya ng'wawe; nguno waalī wababisa a banhū abo walī wabatūma ū Yoshwa kūja kwīdata ī Yeliko. Kūshisha nī lelo īyī akwikalaga hamò na Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoshwa wilahīla alīhaya gīkī, “Ni azumagwe na SEEBA",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
